\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，大气压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_0 = 76\\mathrm{cmHg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。忽略B管的体积和水银槽内液面的变化，当环境温度从 "},{"type":"math","value":"300\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":" 缓慢下降的过程中：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eaf544c294094877ba92b546d3b924cf87e151f725ad2bd43ced727d7abb2563.png","width":167,"height":358,"width_mm":19.506,"row_group":"beidouxingmeng-2504-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1) A泡内气体分子动能（填空）(选填“均增大”、“均减小”或“增大和减小均有”), 其内壁单位面积受到的气体分子的平均作用力（填空）(选填“变大”“变小”或“不变”);\n第15题图\n（2）该装置能测出的最低温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）已知分子平均动能跟热力学温度成正比，其关系满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{k}} = kT(k = 0.2\\mathrm{J / K})"},{"type":"text","value":" ，环境温度下降至（2）问中的 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，外界对气体做功为2.9J，求热量的变化 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）【答案】\n（1）增大和减小均有；……1分\n因为气体体积不变，温度降低压强减小，单位面积受到的气体分子的平均作用力也变\n小。\n……1分\n（2）由等容变化，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{P_{1}}{T_{1}}=\\frac{P_{2}}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"……2分\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}=\\frac{P_{2}}{P_{1}}T_{1}=250K"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n（3）内能减小；"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=k\\Delta T=10J"},{"type":"text","value":"，……1分\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=W+Q,\\quad Q=-12.9J"},{"type":"text","value":"放出热量12.9J ……2分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2504-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2504","source_question_id":"beidouxingmeng-2504-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"1c2dd695ae76d25b82c8fb25075e1582b5e36a5891a2a475ba547a5a6d9c1a5d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. (11 分)一游戏装置由弹射器, 水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" , 圆心为 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的竖直半圆细管道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BCD"},{"type":"text","value":" , 圆心为 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的竖直半圆轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"DEF"},{"type":"text","value":" , 水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"IJ"},{"type":"text","value":" 和足够长的固定斜面组成。滑板静止在 "},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":" 上, 其上表面与 "},{"type":"math","value":"IJ"},{"type":"text","value":" 相平, 左端位于 "},{"type":"math","value":"GF"},{"type":"text","value":" 连线上, 其上静置滑块乙, "},{"type":"math","value":"BO_{1}DO_{2}GF"},{"type":"text","value":" 在同一条竖直线上。\n如图所示，游戏时，滑块甲从 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点弹出，经过轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"BCD"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"DEF"},{"type":"text","value":" 后与滑块乙发生弹性碰撞，随后滑块乙带动滑板一起运动，滑板到达侧壁 HI 后即被锁定。已知滑块甲、乙和滑板的质量分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}=0.01kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" （大小未知），M=0.02kg，轨道 GH 长 L=1.4m，滑板右端距侧壁 HI 的距离 d=0.2m，BCD、DEF 的半径均为 R=0.1m，滑块乙与滑板间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其余各处均光滑，各轨道间平滑连接，弹簧的弹性势能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p}=0.12J"},{"type":"text","value":" ，弹射时从静止释放且弹簧的弹性势能完全转化为滑块动能，滑块甲、乙均可视为质点。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8903e1e2577d2c909fd312028d3814381e6c15aa00379543bb91ce2c1889f7a4.png","width":472,"height":392,"width_mm":55.391,"row_group":"beidouxingmeng-2504-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16题图\n（1）求滑块甲运动到轨道 DEF 最高点 F 时受到的压力大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}=0.01kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求整个过程中，滑块乙与滑板间的摩擦内能 Q；\n（3）若滑板长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"l=\\frac{16}{45}m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，左端仍位于GF连线上。要求滑块甲、乙碰撞后，甲在反弹后不脱离轨道(返回接触到弹射器后即被锁定)，乙在滑板到达侧壁前不脱离滑板，求滑块乙的质量取值范围。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. (11 分)【答案】\n（1）滑块甲，从 A 到 F 过程中，由能量守恒，知"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p}=m_{1}g4R+\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n得 v=4m/s\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}+m_{1}g=m_{1}\\frac{v^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=1.5N"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n(2) 经判断，滑块乙和滑板在达到共速前，滑板已到达侧壁并被锁定。\n对滑板"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu m_{2}gd=\\frac{1}{2}MV^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得 V=1m/s ……1 分\n滑块甲、乙发生弹性碰撞，交换速度。\n对滑板和滑块乙"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}v=m_{2}v'+MV\\quad v'=2m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n此过程，滑块乙相对滑板的相对位移为 x，\n对滑板和滑块乙"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu m_{2}gx=\\frac{1}{2}m_{2}v^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}m_{2}v'^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}MV^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得 x=1m，\n滑板和滑块乙组成的系统克服摩擦力做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{1}=0.05J"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n此后滑块乙继续在滑块上滑动，经轨道 IJ 和斜面后，速度等大反向滑回滑板至速度为零，\n此过程中，滑块乙克服摩擦力做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}m_{2}v'^{2}=0.02J"},{"type":"text","value":"整个过程中，"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=W_{1}+W_{2}=0.07J"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n(3) ①当滑板甲返回时恰好不脱离轨道，"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}g=m_{1}\\frac{v_{1}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=1m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"方向水平向左 ..... 1 分\n滑板甲、乙碰撞时，"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}v=m_{1}v_{1}+m_{2}v_{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}m_{2}v_{2}^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}=\\frac{v-v_{1}}{v+v_{1}}m_{1}=\\frac{5}{3}\\times0.01kg=\\frac{1}{60}kg"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n为滑块甲不脱离轨道时，滑块乙的最小质量。\n②当滑块乙恰好不脱离滑板，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu m_{2}gl=\\frac{1}{2}m_{2}v_{2}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}(m_{2}+M)v_{\\text{共}}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}v_{2}=(m_{2}+M)v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=\\frac{2m_{1}}{m_{1}+m_{2}}v"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}=0.02kg"},{"type":"text","value":"，此时滑板右端未到达侧壁。为乙在滑板到达侧壁前不脱离滑板的最小质量。\n比较后，知最小质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}=0.02kg"},{"type":"text","value":"。 ..... 1 分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2504-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2504","source_question_id":"beidouxingmeng-2504-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e8d7cd5a56594c3c26f37cfffba794113cd56daf0de02f97e51ac30f0ec355e4","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12 分)某探究小组利用电磁阻尼原理设计了一减震装置，其简化结构如图 1 所示。质量为 m 的“日”字型金属框架 abcdef 由 7 根长度均为 l，电阻均为 r 的金属杆焊接而成，水平有界匀强磁场的高度也为 l，水平足够宽广，磁感应强度大小为 B。开始时水平杆 af 与磁场的上边界平行。框架由某一高度下落，以初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 进入磁场，磁场中框架运动的速度 v 与下落距离 x 之间的 "},{"type":"math","value":"v \\sim x"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像如图 2 所示，则\n（1）框架刚进入磁场时受到的安培力的大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）穿过磁场过程中，框架上产生的焦耳热 Q；\n（3）框架在磁场中运动时间 t。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8a75f95aeb01be46d23e374c66845fb1dde678d967203f7a58db5cb7e38854ee.png","width":252,"height":258,"width_mm":29.444,"row_group":"beidouxingmeng-2504-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图 1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3debc95d2c788e719a5b517e40585357d3aa414c4f8d0e0f87b10372bbfb2ca7.png","width":268,"height":226,"width_mm":31.468,"row_group":"beidouxingmeng-2504-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图 2\n第 17 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12 分)【答案】\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"E=Blv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"R=\\frac{15}{4}r"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{E}{R}"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{4Blv_{0}}{15r}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=BIl=\\frac{4B^{2}l^{2}v_{0}}{15r}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n(2) 由"},{"type":"math","value":"v\\sim x"},{"type":"text","value":"图像知，在"},{"type":"math","value":"2l\\sim3l"},{"type":"text","value":"时，框架匀速运动，"},{"type":"math","value":"mg=F_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=\\frac{4B^{2}l^{2}v_{1}}{15r}"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\frac{15mgr}{4B^{2}l^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n框架在运动过程中，总的焦耳热为 Q，"},{"type":"math","value":"3mgl-Q=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=3mgl+\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}-\\frac{225m^{3}g^{2}r^{2}}{32B^{4}l^{4}}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"mgt_{1}-\\frac{4B^{2}l^{3}}{15r}=mv_{2}-mv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"mgt_{2}-\\frac{2B^{2}l^{3}}{5r}=mv_{1}-mv_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"mgt_{3}-\\frac{4B^{2}l^{3}}{15r}=mv_{1}-mv_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{15mr}{4B^{2}l^{2}}-\\frac{v_{0}}{g}+\\frac{14B^{2}l^{3}}{15mgr}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2504-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2504","source_question_id":"beidouxingmeng-2504-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d5906aed73db19d3cc43987bbce8381608b853c453569fecc8c011c39cd80f65","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）正负电子对撞机是研究粒子基本性质和相互作用的实验装置。正负电子经加速器加速到极高速度后，射入对撞测量区域，通过调整测量区的磁感应强度大小，使正负电子发生正碰。一实验探究小组设计的对撞机结构原理图如图所示，测量区ABCD中存在两个有界匀强磁场，水平虚线 MN 下方I区域磁场的磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" (大小未知)，方向垂直纸面向外，MN 上方II区域磁场的磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" (大小未知)，方向垂直纸面向里，直线 EF 为测量区的中线。在同一水平面上的直线加速器甲、乙同时以相同速率分别垂直 AB、CD 边界射入电子和正电子，并最终在 EF 上的某处实现正碰。已知正、负电子的比荷为 k，边界 AB、CD 间的距离为 4d，两加速器与 MN 的距离均为 d，忽略电荷间的相互作用及正、负电子的重力。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4e9f5fc8642b7628de86844cc4148c57dbbe9406b6100e046f5492c6091cc192.png","width":586,"height":355,"width_mm":68.825,"row_group":"beidouxingmeng-2504-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图\n（1）电子以速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 射入 I 区域，\n①若电子能垂直 MN 进入II区域，求 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n②若 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}=\\frac{1.8v_{0}}{kd}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，为使电子不从AB射出，求Ⅱ区域磁场的最小值 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1} = B_{2} = B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，为使正负电子在 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" 上某处发生正碰，求射入磁场的速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间满足的关系。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13 分)【答案】\n(1) ①加速器甲射出电子，在I区域中的半径 r=d ..... 1 分\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"ev_{0}B_{1}=m\\frac{v_{0}^{2}}{d}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}=\\frac{mv_{0}}{ed}=\\frac{v_{0}}{kd}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n②如图所示，轨迹与"},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":"恰好相切于"},{"type":"math","value":"G"},{"type":"text","value":"点时，对应磁感应强度最小。 ……1分在\n△"},{"type":"math","value":"HIO_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"中，"},{"type":"math","value":"r_1 = \\frac{d}{1.8} \\quad \\cos \\theta = \\frac{d - r_1}{r_1} = 0.8 \\quad \\theta = 37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分在"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta GO_{1}O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"中，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta = \\frac{r_2}{r_1 + r_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"r_2 = \\frac{d}{1.2}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分II区域磁场的最小值"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2} = \\frac{1.2v_{0}}{kd}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2fef6b6e117a00aa2960cacdeaf674cfbf338d3a289b77afb6d9709f69a8f80e.png","width":227,"height":286,"width_mm":28.7},{"type":"text","value":"(2) 若正负电子在"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"上方正碰, 正负电子奇数次穿过"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":", 以第 1 次经过"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"的点到边界的弦长作为一段, 分别把"},{"type":"math","value":"2d"},{"type":"text","value":"均分为 2、6、10... 段, 每段"},{"type":"math","value":"d_x = \\frac{d}{2n-1} (n=1, 2, 3\\dots)"},{"type":"text","value":"由"},{"type":"math","value":"r^2 = (d - r)^2 + d_x^2"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{kdB}{2}(1 + \\frac{1}{(2n-1)^2})(n=1, 2, 3\\dots)"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1 分正负电子偶数次穿过"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":", 以第 1 次经过"},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":"的点到边界的弦长作为一段, 分别把"},{"type":"math","value":"2d"},{"type":"text","value":"均分为 4、8、12... 段, 每段"},{"type":"math","value":"d_x = \\frac{d}{2n} (n=1, 2, 3\\dots)"},{"type":"text","value":"同理, 得"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{kdB}{2}(1 + \\frac{1}{(2n)^2})(n=1, 2, 3\\dots)"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1 分因此, 速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":"与"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"之间满足的关系为:"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{kdB}{2}(1 + \\frac{1}{n^2})(n=1, 2, 3\\dots)"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1 分分析粒子在 II 区域磁场"},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":"相切时,"},{"type":"math","value":"r = 2(2 - \\sqrt{3})d"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_0 = 2(2 - \\sqrt{3})kBd"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1 分要求"},{"type":"math","value":"v \\geq v_0"},{"type":"text","value":"即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{kdB}{2}(1 + \\frac{1}{n^2}) \\geq 2(2 - \\sqrt{3})kBd"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"n=1, 2, 3"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1 分综上,"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{kdB}{2}(1 + \\frac{1}{n^2})(n=1, 2, 3)"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1 分"}]}}]}
